---
import PostLayout from '../../layouts/PostLayout.astro';
import ParallaxBand from '../../components/ParallaxBand.astro';
---

<PostLayout
  pageTitle="Verona: Of Bridges &amp; Brawls | Expeditions"
  heroTitle="Verona"
  heroSubtitle="Of Bridges &amp; Brawls"
  heroStyle="background-image: url('https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/03.jpg')"
  date="OCTOBER 8TH, 2020"
  location="Verona, VR, Italy"
  footnote="&copy; Zubin John"
  moreTitle="More Expeditions"
  description="The Arena di Verona, Piazza Bra, and the Roman ruins of Verona's old city. October 2020."
  ogImage="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/03.jpg"
>
  <Fragment slot="nav-left">Expeditions</Fragment>
  <a slot="nav-right" class="back-btn" href="/expeditions/">&#8592; All Expeditions</a>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="text">
      <p class="lede">
        Built in 30 AD, the Arena di Verona has seen its fair share of crowds, cheers, and sandaled feet.
        Earlier a gladiatorial theatre, in modern times an event venue, and in 2026 the chosen site for the
        closing ceremony of the Winter Olympics. Very, very functional, even 2000 years later.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROW 1: 07, 04 -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/07.jpg" alt="Verona photo 7" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/04.jpg" alt="Verona photo 4" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROW 2: 12, then the caption below it -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2plus1">
      <figure class="span-2">
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/12.jpg" alt="Verona photo 12" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <figcaption>One really needs to marvel at the beauty of these Roman arcs, not just along the periphery of the arena but all across town. Verona is essentially an open-air museum of Roman architecture, and the Arena sits at its heart like a still-beating pulse.</figcaption>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PASTEL PARAGRAPH, then full page width 05 (no parallax) -->
  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        The pastel shades of the Piazza Bra are best appreciated from the upper stands of the colosseum. On a
        lazy afternoon, one can bask in the ambient sounds of the daily hustle of the cafes and their many
        patrons below.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FULL BLEED: 05 -->
  <section class="full-bleed">
    <figure>
      <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/05.jpg" alt="Verona photo 5" /></div>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        Gorgeous Roman ruins are scattered all across town. A stroll through the old city is a definite
        recommendation. The density of ancient stonework embedded into the everyday fabric of cafes, piazzas,
        and narrow streets makes Verona unlike almost any other Italian city.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROW: 17 -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2plus1">
      <figure class="span-2">
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/17.jpg" alt="Verona photo 17" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROW: 13, 15 -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/13.jpg" alt="Verona photo 13" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/15.jpg" alt="Verona photo 15" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FULL WIDTH, PARALLAX: 14 -->
  <ParallaxBand image="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/14.jpg" alt="Verona photo 14" />

  <!-- ROW: 16, 08 -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/16.jpg" alt="Verona photo 16" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/08.jpg" alt="Verona photo 8" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROW: 10 -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2plus1">
      <figure class="span-2">
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/10.jpg" alt="Verona photo 10" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROW: 01, 02 -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/01.jpg" alt="Verona photo 1" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/verona/02.jpg" alt="Verona photo 2" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MORE CARDS -->
  <Fragment slot="more-cards">
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/innsbruck/">
      <div class="more-thumb"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/innsbruck/05.jpg" alt="" /></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Into the Alps: Innsbruck</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Oct 2021</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Altstadt, Nordkette, and Castle Ambras</p>
    </a>
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/salzburg/">
      <div class="more-thumb"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/salzburg/04.jpg" alt="" /></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Into the Alps: Salzburg</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Oct 2021</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Untersberg, Hohensalzburg, and the Sound of Music</p>
    </a>
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/andaman/">
      <div class="more-thumb"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/08.jpg" alt="" /></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Andaman Sands</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Jan 2019</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Phuket sunsets, rock pools, and island hopping</p>
    </a>
  </Fragment>
</PostLayout>
